  [Purpose statement], [Event host], [A written statement of the business purpose and the intended outcome of the occasion],
  [Category confirmation], [Engaging partner], [Written confirmation of the venue category and the approval route],
  [Guest list preparation], [Event host], [A current list of invitees with organizations and titles, free of stale entries],
  [Data protection screening], [Event host with Records Office], [Confirmation that dietary, accessibility, and consent data are collected lawfully],
  [Logistics and vendor confirmation], [Office administrator], [Signed venue confirmation covering menu, schedule, and contingency],
  [Execution], [Named host on the night], [Attendance record and a note of any deviation from the confirmed plan],
  [Post-event review], [Practice director], [A short review of outcome against purpose, filed within five working days],
